```javascript
const { Client, GatewayIntentBits } = require('discord.js');
const { Routes } = require('@discordjs/rest');
```

5. Initialize a new Discord client and set the intents:

```javascript
const client = new Client({ intents: [GatewayIntentBits.Guilds] });
```

